    <StreamGeometry x:Key="ThoughtCloudIcon">M5,15.5 A2.6,2.6 0 1 1 6.3,10.6 A3.4,3.4 0 1 1 13.2,8.3 A3,3 0 1 1 18.6,10.8 A2.6,2.6 0 1 1 17.5,15.5 Z M8,18.5 A1.3,1.3 0 1 1 8,21.1 A1.3,1.3 0 1 1 8,18.5 Z M6,22 A0.8,0.8 0 1 1 6,23.6 A0.8,0.8 0 1 1 6,22 Z</StreamGeometry>
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="AddBubbleIcon">M12,3 C6.5,3 2,6.6 2,11 C2,13.6 3.6,15.9 6,17.3 L5,21.5 L9.8,18.6 C10.5,18.8 11.3,18.9 12,18.9 C17.5,18.9 22,15.3 22,11 C22,6.6 17.5,3 12,3 Z M11,7 V10 H8 V12 H11 V15 H13 V12 H16 V10 H13 V7 Z</StreamGeometry>
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="TextIcon">M4,3 H20 V8 H18 V5 H13 V19 H16 V21 H8 V19 H11 V5 H6 V8 H4 Z</StreamGeometry>
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="PasteIcon">M5,4 H8 V6 H16 V4 H19 C19.6,4 20,4.4 20,5 V21 C20,21.6 19.6,22 19,22 H5 C4.4,22 4,21.6 4,21 V5 C4,4.4 4.4,4 5,4 Z M6,8 V20 H18 V8 Z M9,2 H15 V5.5 H9 Z M8,10 H16 V12 H8 Z M8,14 H14 V16 H8 Z</StreamGeometry>
