    <StreamGeometry x:Key="PenIcon">M3,21 L3.9,16.4 L15.6,4.7 L19.3,8.4 L7.6,20.1 Z M16.8,3.5 L18.4,1.9 C18.9,1.4 19.7,1.4 20.2,1.9 L22.1,3.8 C22.6,4.3 22.6,5.1 22.1,5.6 L20.5,7.2 Z</StreamGeometry>
    <!-- A pen nib, the classic vector "place points" tool: Insert › Freeform. -->
